WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.069
From calorie count to portion sizes,

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.504
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.940
between Krispy Kreme in the UK and the US.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.408
This is Food Wars.

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.915
In the UK, we can get doughnuts
in four portion sizes.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.685
As a single doughnut,

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:20.887
as a three,

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:23.590
a dozen,

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:30.130
or you'll be the life of the
party with a double dozen.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:32.432
In the US, you can get
your doughnuts in single,

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:35.869
In the US, you can get
your doughnuts in single,

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.205
two, if you get it with a coffee combo,

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:40.140
three-pack,

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:44.778
dozen – look at these beauties –

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:47.313
or two dozen.

00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:51.618
Now technically, the double dozen

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:53.319
isn't the biggest thing on the UK menu.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.422
Krispy Kreme in the UK
will cater for events

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:57.357
like your weddings or your parties.

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:59.492
And they can do something
called a doughnut wall,

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:04.097
which contains 216 doughnuts
hanging on pegs on a wall.

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:05.298
That's 18 dozen.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.000
Krispy Kreme will also make you something

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.268
called the doughnut tower.

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:09.836
It looks almost like a wedding cake

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:12.906
and is made of around 216 doughnuts.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.174
You've got to give them a heads up though,

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:15.809
because I went to the Krispy Kreme today

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.477
and asked for one and they said no.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.845
Also in the US at Krispy Kreme

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:21.581
you can get mini doughnuts in four or 20.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.549
I have to know.

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:26.519
Uh oh, I'm in trouble.

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:27.220
I don't know if I'm going to make it

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:27.854
through this shoot, Conner.

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.489
These are so good.

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:30.957
This right here is a standard

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:35.328
USA Krispy Kreme classic glazed doughnut.

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:38.598
I want to bite into you so bad.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.568
But before that, let's weigh it.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.770
Now we're going to weigh a
glazed doughnut in the UK

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.238
to see what it comes to.

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:49.275
Oh, they're so light.

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:52.745
In the UK, our hot coffee
sizes are regular and large.

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:54.047
US Krispy Kreme,

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:56.216
you can get your coffee in three sizes:

00:01:56.216 --> 00:01:58.618
small, medium, and large.

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.120
And if you're really thirsty,

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:02.689
you can get yourself a Brew Box.

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:04.891
Nice.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:06.259
A large hot coffee in the UK

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:07.527
is supposed to be 16 ounces.

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.362
So we're going to measure that
to find out if that's true.

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:10.797
And to make sure that this reading

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:12.232
is absolutely accurate,

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:13.666
got a big boy.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:21.674
OK.

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:22.909
Krispy Kreme in the US,

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:24.878
you can get your iced
coffees in two sizes,

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:26.212
medium and large.

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:28.515
Iced coffees in the UK
also come in two sizes,

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:29.349
regular and large.

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:31.584
They use the same cups as the hot coffees.

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:32.552
They've ditched the plastic ones

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:33.920
apparently to cut down on plastic waste.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:37.423
And now we're going to measure
our iced coffee, black.

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:43.263
Oh, definitely more coffee.

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:44.531
Now besides doughnut walls,

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:46.266
the biggest thing on the UK menu is this,

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:47.400
the Sharer Bundle.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.568
It's four dozen doughnuts,

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:51.371
and it comes to 41 pounds and 95 pence.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.973
This here is the largest single menu item

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:55.608
you can get at a US Krispy Kreme.

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.377
It is the Meet and Greet.

00:02:57.544 --> 00:03:02.549
Two dozen assorted doughnuts
and a Brew Box, all for $42.95.

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:06.653
Let's look at nutrition.

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:09.489
This is a classic ring glazed
doughnut from Krispy Kreme,

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:12.926
and it contains 200
calories, 8.3 grams of fat,

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:16.396
12.6 grams of sugar, and
96 milligrams of sodium.

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:19.933
That same doughnut in
the US is 190 calories,

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:22.101
11 grams of fat, 10 grams of sugar,

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:24.070
and 85 milligrams of sodium.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.439
Ours is less with everything except fat.

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:28.474
Few people can stop
after just one doughnut.

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:29.943
So if you just had to have three of these,

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:30.843
the calories go up.

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:32.579
Now you're looking at 600 calories,

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:34.480
which is 30% of your daily allowance.

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:36.082
And in the US, these three doughnuts

00:03:36.082 --> 00:03:37.584
are slightly less in calories.

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:39.252
It's 570 over here.

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:42.322
But look at how much sugar
these three doughnuts had.

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:44.357
It's almost three-fourths

00:03:44.357 --> 00:03:45.825
what you should be having in one day.

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:48.361
Speaking honestly though, if I have these

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:49.963
it's not like I'm going
to have a salad for lunch.

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:51.898
Getting a dozen doughnuts
for you and your friends

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:52.999
or just yourself,

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:55.635
that would put you at 2,400 calories.

00:03:56.002 --> 00:04:00.807
And in the US, our dozen
comes to 2,280 calories.

00:04:00.807 --> 00:04:03.543
I would hope you wouldn't eat
all 12 of these by yourself.

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:05.545
But if you do, I guess
that's all the calories

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:06.779
you're going to need for the day.

00:04:06.779 --> 00:04:08.581
I could eat 12 of these, easy.

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:10.083
Another popular doughnut at Krispy Kreme

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:11.084
is the chocolate glazed.

00:04:11.084 --> 00:04:12.318
Just ignore the sprinkles on ours

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:13.786
because we didn't have any plain ones.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.788
Now, this one is 237 calories

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:17.156
and also beats the classic glazed

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:18.458
in pretty much every other metric,

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:20.393
probably because of
the chocolate frosting.

00:04:20.627 --> 00:04:24.430
Our US chocolate glazed is 240 calories.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:25.898
So it looks like the chocolate glaze

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:27.433
helped put us over the top.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:28.101
What?

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:29.902
If you want even more
calories in your doughnuts,

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:32.405
how about the UK's
chocolate iced with custard?

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:34.707
Now this one is 289 calories.

00:04:34.707 --> 00:04:36.743
And ours is 300 calories.

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:38.711
300, just this one doughnut?

00:04:39.379 --> 00:04:40.847
I'm definitely going to regret it.

00:04:41.381 --> 00:04:42.282
That tastes so good.

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:44.884
In the UK, the most calorific
doughnut is this one,

00:04:44.884 --> 00:04:46.085
the Lotus Biscoff doughnut.

00:04:46.085 --> 00:04:48.821
It's 396 calories.

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:50.490
The most calorific

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:52.325
doughnut you can get at a Krispy Kreme,

00:04:52.325 --> 00:04:53.960
at least in America, is something called

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.663
the chocolate chip cookie dough doughnut,

00:04:56.663 --> 00:04:58.398
made with Chips Ahoy! cookies.

00:04:58.398 --> 00:05:00.933
And it is 400 calories.

00:05:00.933 --> 00:05:03.403
They weren't available where we went.

00:05:03.403 --> 00:05:05.305
And the second most calorific
doughnut you can get

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:08.675
at a Krispy Kreme is the Oreo
Cookies and Kreme doughnut.

00:05:08.675 --> 00:05:10.810
That's 390 calories.

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:13.279
Also couldn't get it.

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:16.883
The third most calorific doughnut

00:05:16.883 --> 00:05:18.918
you can get at a Krispy
Kreme in the United States

00:05:18.918 --> 00:05:21.220
is the double dark chocolate doughnut.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.989
370 calories.

00:05:24.023 --> 00:05:24.857
No.

00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:28.094
And the fourth most calorific
doughnut you can get

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:31.664
at a US Krispy Kreme is
the cake batter doughnut.

00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:33.232
360 calories.

00:05:35.935 --> 00:05:37.103
We got it.

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:38.538
This is a nice-looking,
this is like white.

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:41.874
I mean, this is sprinkles, it's colorful.

00:05:42.342 --> 00:05:44.243
Oh man, I'm fading fast.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.112
I shouldn't, I'm going to
drink all those coffees.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.014
What about the drinks?

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:50.516
Well, this is a large mocha with 2% milk.

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:53.886
And in the UK it contains 247 calories,

00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:56.489
16.3 grams of fat, 12 grams of sugar,

00:05:56.489 --> 00:05:57.924
and 80 milligrams of sodium.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:01.594
In the US, our large
mocha is 480 calories,

00:06:01.594 --> 00:06:05.965
1 gram of sugar, and 260
milligrams of sodium.

00:06:05.965 --> 00:06:08.301
Come here, you salty mocha dog.

00:06:09.402 --> 00:06:10.937
Whoa, this is good.

00:06:10.937 --> 00:06:12.472
I'm surprised, I thought
I wasn't going to like it.

00:06:12.472 --> 00:06:13.873
I normally don't get chocolatey drinks.

00:06:14.073 --> 00:06:15.308
If you get this as an iced coffee,

00:06:15.308 --> 00:06:18.277
it contains 280 calories,
12 grams of sugar,

00:06:18.277 --> 00:06:20.012
and 14 milligrams of sodium.

00:06:20.079 --> 00:06:21.080
Do you want to get it iced?

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.916
Now the calories are
420, 2 grams of sugar,

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:25.985
and 190 milligrams of sodium.

00:06:25.985 --> 00:06:27.920
Since the UK and US sizes are different,

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.856
we've calculated it per fluid ounce.

00:06:29.856 --> 00:06:31.724
And we found some pretty
shocking differences.

00:06:31.724 --> 00:06:35.161
From the UK to the US, there's
a 55.5% calorie increase,

00:06:35.161 --> 00:06:40.166
a 93.3% sugar decrease,
and a 160% sodium increase.

00:06:47.707 --> 00:06:48.975
I've eaten way too many doughnuts

00:06:48.975 --> 00:06:49.809
on this thing, dude.

00:06:49.809 --> 00:06:51.878
I'm losing, losing my ---ing mind.

00:06:52.378 --> 00:06:54.414
And in the US, our doughnut

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:57.250
is made up of:

00:07:02.755 --> 00:07:04.590
I'm getting better at this.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:11.164
And it contains less than
2% of each of the following:

00:07:25.044 --> 00:07:27.413
Ah yes, our old friend BHT,

00:07:27.413 --> 00:07:31.184
aka butylated hydroxytoluene?

00:07:32.084 --> 00:07:33.719
It is banned in the European Union.

00:07:33.719 --> 00:07:37.023
The International Agency for
Research on Cancer suggests,

00:07:37.023 --> 00:07:40.626
might I say strongly suggests,
there is sufficient evidence

00:07:40.626 --> 00:07:44.330
that BHT causes tumor
growth in lab animals.

00:07:44.363 --> 00:07:46.466
Also, according to WebMD,

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:49.402
BHT is also used to treat genital herpes.

00:07:52.104 --> 00:07:52.772
All right:

00:07:54.774 --> 00:07:57.143
Yolks, yolks, egg yolks.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:11.591
All right, scratch that.

00:08:11.591 --> 00:08:13.426
I'm having a tough time with this one.

00:08:18.064 --> 00:08:23.069
That last guy, diammonium
phosphate, aka DAP

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:25.304
Not the sequel to WAP.

00:08:25.371 --> 00:08:28.975
It is also used as a fertilizer
and as a fire retardant.

00:08:28.975 --> 00:08:32.745
So when we have the next
wildfire outbreaks in the state,

00:08:32.745 --> 00:08:34.013
because it definitely will happen,

00:08:34.013 --> 00:08:35.448
we're going to start
dropping Krispy Kremes

00:08:35.448 --> 00:08:36.816
on those wildfires.

00:08:36.816 --> 00:08:38.618
Problem solved.

00:08:39.886 --> 00:08:40.586
In the UK,

00:08:40.586 --> 00:08:42.455
a glazed doughnut is
made of the following:

00:09:23.162 --> 00:09:25.131
Oh, they're not done.
No.

00:09:25.131 --> 00:09:26.832
Nope, there's more.

00:09:26.832 --> 00:09:28.134
That was the doughnut.

00:09:28.134 --> 00:09:30.369
Now we're going to talk
about what's in the glaze.

00:09:30.436 --> 00:09:31.871
Sugar, water ...

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:36.342
That's a lot of
ingredients for a doughnut.

00:09:36.409 --> 00:09:37.310
One thing worth pointing out

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.678
is the differences in the sprinkles

00:09:38.678 --> 00:09:40.146
between the UK and the US.

00:09:40.313 --> 00:09:41.714
Three of the colorings used in the US

00:09:41.714 --> 00:09:44.116
are actually subject to
restrictions in the European Union.

00:09:44.116 --> 00:09:46.218
And if they're included in
foods, they must bear a warning

00:09:46.218 --> 00:09:48.120
that they may cause
hyperactivity in children.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.957
Not here though, baby. Not here.

00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:53.626
Blue 1 isn't actually on this list,

00:09:53.626 --> 00:09:55.995
but it's also very hard
to come by in the UK.

00:09:56.062 --> 00:09:57.763
It was famously removed from Smarties

00:09:57.763 --> 00:09:59.031
in the UK several years ago.

00:09:59.031 --> 00:10:01.367
And it took them three years
to find a natural alternative

00:10:01.367 --> 00:10:03.903
to the blue color, which
ended up being spirulina.

00:10:06.806 --> 00:10:08.407
Here is everything you
can only find on the menu

00:10:08.407 --> 00:10:09.909
at a UK Krispy Kreme.

00:10:09.909 --> 00:10:11.243
And these are all the things

00:10:11.243 --> 00:10:13.679
you can get at a US Krispy Kreme.

00:10:13.813 --> 00:10:15.314
Let's start with some doughnuts.

00:10:15.314 --> 00:10:16.983
The first one we'll look at is this one,

00:10:16.983 --> 00:10:18.517
the Lotus Biscoff.

00:10:18.517 --> 00:10:20.186
Now, Lotus Biscoffs are
those little biscuits

00:10:20.186 --> 00:10:22.421
which you usually get on
the side of a cup of coffee.

00:10:22.421 --> 00:10:24.724
It's like a caramel-flavored
crunchy cookie,

00:10:24.724 --> 00:10:26.325
and we're kind of obsessed
with them in the UK.

00:10:26.325 --> 00:10:29.161
This one comes with some
crumbled-up Biscoff on the top.

00:10:29.161 --> 00:10:31.163
And then I think the icing
also has Biscoff in it.

00:10:31.163 --> 00:10:34.133
And there's also some Biscoff
injected inside as well.

00:10:34.233 --> 00:10:35.635
Next up, we have this one,

00:10:35.635 --> 00:10:37.536
which is a chocolate dream cake.

00:10:37.603 --> 00:10:39.271
Caramel iced ring doughnut.

00:10:39.271 --> 00:10:41.340
Nutty filled berry ring doughnut.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.175
The purple Love Hearts doughnut.

00:10:43.175 --> 00:10:44.910
Now this one's been
produced in collaboration

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.679
with Love Hearts, the candy,

00:10:46.679 --> 00:10:49.348
as you can see by the
very cute phrase on top.

00:10:49.348 --> 00:10:51.183
This is a varied thing.

00:10:51.183 --> 00:10:53.019
We just got one that says OMG.

00:10:53.052 --> 00:10:56.389
Next up, we have the Caramel
Sensation, Nutty Chocolatta.

00:10:56.389 --> 00:10:58.157
Now it's actually a heart-shaped doughnut

00:10:58.157 --> 00:10:59.558
with some chocolate icing on top.

00:10:59.558 --> 00:11:02.628
And importantly, it's full of Nutella.

00:11:03.929 --> 00:11:05.498
That's a little bit underwhelming.

00:11:05.498 --> 00:11:07.500
I wanted more Nutella to come out there.

00:11:09.201 --> 00:11:10.136
Pretty good.

00:11:10.136 --> 00:11:12.104
And these are all the exclusive items

00:11:12.104 --> 00:11:14.140
you can get at a US Krispy Kreme.

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:15.941
OK, so the US Krispy Kreme

00:11:15.941 --> 00:11:20.946
has so many exclusive USA-only doughnuts.

00:11:21.213 --> 00:11:23.582
But they're not available
at every Krispy Kreme.

00:11:23.582 --> 00:11:25.418
So the one we specifically went to

00:11:25.418 --> 00:11:28.154
had about a dozen of those doughnuts.

00:11:28.154 --> 00:11:30.256
An original filled chocolate cream.

00:11:30.256 --> 00:11:31.590
So you can see in the
little white spot there

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:34.060
that that is where they
put the cream in there.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.728
Pretty sure that's an apple fritter.

00:11:35.728 --> 00:11:37.296
That's the birthday cake.

00:11:37.296 --> 00:11:41.567
And what we saw before, chocolate
icing filled with custard.

00:11:42.468 --> 00:11:44.503
Yeah, that's definitely a custard one.

00:11:44.503 --> 00:11:46.439
Can you see the yellow in there?

00:11:46.672 --> 00:11:47.640
I'm going to assume this is

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:50.042
maybe the glazed sour cream cake?

00:11:50.042 --> 00:11:52.278
Sugared ring and cinnamon sugared ring.

00:11:52.611 --> 00:11:54.213
See this eclair right here?

00:11:54.213 --> 00:11:57.049
New York City cheesecake.

00:11:57.116 --> 00:11:58.884
Glazed raspberry-filled.

00:12:00.319 --> 00:12:03.689
Oh, God.

00:12:07.093 --> 00:12:08.828
That's not that much stuff in here.

00:12:10.296 --> 00:12:12.264
So good.

00:12:15.534 --> 00:12:17.103
I'm going to be so sick, and I don't care.

00:12:17.103 --> 00:12:18.437
Also at the US Krispy Kreme,

00:12:18.437 --> 00:12:20.272
you can get these doughnut holes.

00:12:20.272 --> 00:12:23.142
They put them in these cups
that might be reusable.

00:12:23.676 --> 00:12:29.482
The UK does not have these,
as before mentioned, minis.

00:12:29.682 --> 00:12:32.218
It's usually 20, but the
crew got to them too fast.

00:12:32.218 --> 00:12:33.319
I couldn't stop them.

00:12:33.319 --> 00:12:34.520
Couldn't stop them.

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:36.021
Now on top of the doughnuts themselves,

00:12:36.021 --> 00:12:37.723
the UK also has exclusive ways

00:12:37.723 --> 00:12:38.758
of presenting the doughnuts.

00:12:38.824 --> 00:12:42.027
For example, here we have a birthday box.

00:12:42.027 --> 00:12:43.696
And you can also get a doughnut

00:12:43.696 --> 00:12:45.264
with a customized message printed on it.

00:12:45.264 --> 00:12:47.066
Unfortunately, we didn't
give them enough warning.

00:12:47.066 --> 00:12:48.801
So maybe if the editor
can just add one here,

00:12:48.801 --> 00:12:49.401
that would be great.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.905
The Krispy Kreme in the US

00:12:52.905 --> 00:12:55.741
has a lot of varieties
of hot and cold drinks.

00:12:55.741 --> 00:12:57.176
You can get your lattes

00:12:57.176 --> 00:13:01.514
in a version of vanilla,
caramel, or white chocolate.

00:13:01.514 --> 00:13:03.315
And then the iced drinks.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.485
Same rules as before.

00:13:06.485 --> 00:13:09.655
Everything has a vanilla, white chocolate,

00:13:09.655 --> 00:13:11.524
and caramel version.

00:13:11.524 --> 00:13:13.159
This right here is the Malibu Dream.

00:13:13.159 --> 00:13:16.228
It is a strawberry,
banana, and vanilla shake.

00:13:17.696 --> 00:13:18.531
It tastes OK.

00:13:18.531 --> 00:13:19.932
And we actually have a
few more things I forgot.

00:13:20.766 --> 00:13:22.301
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:13:22.301 --> 00:13:24.303
Get bottled drinks to go.

00:13:24.336 --> 00:13:25.304
Krispy Kreme in the UK

00:13:25.304 --> 00:13:26.939
also offers a range of exclusive shakes.

00:13:26.939 --> 00:13:28.374
We have four of them here.

00:13:28.374 --> 00:13:32.311
We have the Oreo shake, a
strawberry and cream shake,

00:13:32.311 --> 00:13:34.713
the Lotus Biscoff shake,

00:13:34.713 --> 00:13:37.249
and then this one is a
chocolate cream shake.

00:13:37.249 --> 00:13:38.717
Back at it again with the Biscoff.

00:13:38.717 --> 00:13:40.019
Like, what's the deal with that?

00:13:40.019 --> 00:13:40.853
Why is everyone so obsessed with Biscoff?

00:13:40.853 --> 00:13:41.987
I don't get it.

00:13:42.454 --> 00:13:44.924
I'm just going to say I don't
like Biscoff, and I'm mad

00:13:44.924 --> 00:13:46.592
that they've put it in so
many things on their menu.

00:13:46.759 --> 00:13:49.395
I'm going to try the Oreo one,
because even though it's sat

00:13:49.395 --> 00:13:50.930
under studio lights for several hours,

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:52.231
it still looks and smells pretty good.

00:13:53.899 --> 00:13:56.335
Woo, that is very sweet, but pretty good.

00:13:56.669 --> 00:13:57.670
We can also get some exclusive

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:00.139
iced drink options in the UK,
including a pink lemonade,

00:14:00.139 --> 00:14:03.642
an original lemonade, a frozen
mango, and a coffee chiller.

00:14:03.642 --> 00:14:05.177
Although unfortunately,
the ice machine was broken

00:14:05.177 --> 00:14:06.512
when we went, so we
couldn't get them today.

00:14:06.512 --> 00:14:08.380
And finally, apparently you guys can't get

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.382
flat whites in the US,
which is surprising,

00:14:10.382 --> 00:14:12.384
because we drink those
all the time in the UK.

00:14:12.384 --> 00:14:15.888
It's kind of just like a latte,
but with slightly less foam.

00:14:15.888 --> 00:14:16.989
Hey, thanks for watching.

00:14:16.989 --> 00:14:17.857
We have a new project coming

00:14:17.857 --> 00:14:18.924
that we're really excited about.

00:14:18.924 --> 00:14:21.594
And we're going to show you a
few seconds of it right now.

00:14:21.594 --> 00:14:23.529
This is a Big Mac.

00:14:23.529 --> 00:14:26.065
And this is everything
that's in a Big Mac.

00:14:26.065 --> 00:14:27.867
Welcome to Fast Food Chemistry.

00:14:27.867 --> 00:14:31.704
I feel like I'm watching
someone making an explosive.

00:14:32.838 --> 00:14:34.874
This is potassium aluminium sulfate.

00:14:34.874 --> 00:14:37.176
Soy lecithin, calcium
chloride, potassium sorbate,

00:14:37.176 --> 00:14:40.179
polyoxyethylene sorbitan monooleate.

00:14:43.182 --> 00:14:43.983
So there you have it.

00:14:43.983 --> 00:14:45.451
Can you tell which one is ours?

00:14:45.451 --> 00:14:47.119
But that looks, it
actually looks pretty good.

00:14:48.621 --> 00:14:50.256
I'm very surprised by that.

00:14:50.256 --> 00:14:51.657
That's right, we used every chemical

00:14:51.657 --> 00:14:53.125
McDonald's uses to make a Big Mac.

00:14:53.125 --> 00:14:54.360
But you'll have to tune in next Sunday

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.661
to see how it turned out.

00:14:55.661 --> 00:14:58.097
Be sure to subscribe to Food
Insider so you don't miss it.

00:14:58.097 --> 00:15:00.232
Soy lecithin.

00:15:02.835 --> 00:15:03.669
Did you hear that?

00:15:03.669 --> 00:15:05.371
Yeah, my stomach's churning,
all these doughnuts.

00:15:05.371 --> 00:15:09.341
This was a mistake and the
best mistake I've ever made.

00:15:09.341 --> 00:15:11.377
I don't care how I feel,
these doughnuts are so good.

